{"id":"future-formal","lv":"c1","n":14,"cat":"tense","t":"Be to, be about to, be due to: tương lai trang trọng","en":"The minister is to visit… · The train is due to arrive…","reg":"formal","sum":"Tương lai trang trọng (tin tức, thông báo, văn bản). be to + V = kế hoạch chính thức (The president is to visit Japan); còn là mệnh lệnh (You are to be home by ten) và, trong câu if, = nếu muốn (If we are to win, …). be about to + V = sắp sửa, ngay lúc này — không đi với mốc thời gian như tomorrow. be due to + V = theo lịch trình (The train is due to arrive at ten). be set to + V = (tin tức) dự kiến sẽ (Prices are set to rise). be on the verge / point of + V-ing / danh từ = sắp, suýt. Tít báo bỏ is / are: President to visit Japan. Trong truyện kể, was to = điều về sau đã xảy ra (He was never to see his home again).","forms":[{"f":"be to + V (kế hoạch chính thức, mệnh lệnh)","vi":"The president is to visit Japan."},{"f":"be about to + V (sắp sửa, ngay bây giờ)","vi":"The film is about to start."},{"f":"be due to / be set to + V","vi":"The train is due to arrive at ten."},{"f":"be on the verge / point of + V-ing","vi":"They're on the verge of winning."}],"pts":[{"id":"future-formal","name":"Formal futures","vi":"Be to, be about to, be due to, be on the verge of"}],"cast":{"linh":{"name":{"en":"Linh","vi":"Linh"},"look":"woman","style":{"outfit":"blouse","top":"#9A6FC4","topShade":"#8159AA","accent":"#8159AA","hair":"bob","hairColor":"#1C1716","skin":"#F2CFAE","skinShade":"#E0B592"},"x":560},"jay":{"name":{"en":"Jay","vi":"Jay"},"look":"man","style":{"outfit":"apron","top":"#2E2E2E","topShade":"#222222","accent":"#707070","hair":"short","hairColor":"#1F1B1A","skin":"#A86F4C","skinShade":"#93603F"},"x":1040}},"bg":"train","beats":[{"k":"e","sec":"hook","en":"Hurry! Our train is due to leave in five minutes.","vi":"Nhanh lên! Tàu mình theo lịch còn năm phút nữa là chạy.","ipa":["ˈhɝi","ˈaʊɚ","tɹeɪn","ɪz","du","tu","liv","ɪn","faɪv","ˈmɪnəts"],"who":"linh","ann":{"expression":"w